Naming note:
  This repository installs the ThoxyMicro family. The ThoxyMicro family is a
  standalone Luckfox Pico Mini B (Rockchip RV1103) prototype track. It is NOT
  a ThoxMini variant. ThoxMini canonical SoC remains Milk-V Duo. ThoxMini Air
  remains Pi Zero W. Filenames in this repo that say "thoxmini" are profile
  labels and do not imply a relationship to ThoxMini hardware.

Third-party components:

  curl, bash, coreutils, systemd / busybox     OS-provided
  GitHub Releases API                          accessed read-only

